---
seoTitle: Privacy questions answered for New Zealand
metaDescription: "Short, sourced answers to the privacy and online safety questions New Zealanders ask most, from recording calls and cameras to landlords and Police."
layout: layouts/base.njk
schemaType: collection
title: Answers to common privacy questions in New Zealand
description: Short, sourced answers to the privacy and online safety questions New Zealanders ask most, from recording calls and neighbour cameras to landlords, employers, Police and the Privacy Act.
permalink: /answers/
---
{%- set headTitle = "Answers" -%}
{%- set headLede = "Short, sourced answers to the questions New Zealanders ask most about privacy and online safety. Each one starts with the answer, then explains the detail and what you can do." -%}
{%- set headFacts -%}<div><dt>Answers</dt><dd>{{ collections.answers | length }}</dd></div><div><dt>Also</dt><dd><a href="/scams/">Current scams</a>, <a href="/glossary/">glossary</a></dd></div>{%- endset -%}
{% include "partials/page-head.njk" %}
{% set groups = [
  ["everyday", "At home and in public"],
  ["work", "At work, renting and with businesses"],
  ["government", "Health, records and Police"],
  ["online", "Online and on your phone"],
  ["rights", "Your Privacy Act rights"],
  ["business", "For businesses and organisations"]
] %}
<div class="band">
{% for g in groups %}
  <section class="group split" aria-labelledby="a-{{ g[0] }}">
    <div class="split-head"><h2 class="group-title" id="a-{{ g[0] }}">{{ g[1] }}</h2></div>
    <ul class="rows">
    {% for a in collections.answers %}{% if a.data.cluster == g[0] %}
      <li><a class="row" href="{{ a.url }}"><span class="row-title">{{ a.data.title }}</span><span class="row-desc">{{ a.data.answer | truncate(150) }}</span></a></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
{% endfor %}
</div>
